# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:69
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "आमुख"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:71
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&konsolekalendar; is a command line interface to calendars. It lets you "
"view, insert, remove, or modify calendar events by way of the command line "
"or from a scripting language. Additionally, &konsolekalendar; can create a "
"new calendar, export a calendar to a variety of other formats, and import "
"another calendar."
msgstr ""
"&konsolekalendar; पञ्चाङ्गानां कृते आदेशपङ्क्ति-अन्तरफलकं भवति । एतत् "
"भवन्तं आदेशपङ्क्तौ अथवा स्क्रिप्टिङ्ग् भाषातः पञ्चाङ्गघटनानि द्रष्टुं, "
"सम्मिलितुं, निष्कासयितुं, परिवर्तयितुं वा शक्नोति । तदतिरिक्तं "
"&konsolekalendar; नूतनं पञ्चाङ्गं निर्मातुम्, अन्येषु विविधस्वरूपेषु "
"पञ्चाङ्गं निर्यातयितुं, अन्यं पञ्चाङ्गं आयातयितुं च शक्नोति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:78
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In its basic mode, &konsolekalendar; displays the list of events in your "
"default calendar for the current day (from 7:00 to 17:00)."
msgstr ""
"तस्य मूलभूतविधाने &konsolekalendar; वर्तमानदिनस्य (7:00 तः 17:00 पर्यन्तं) "
"भवतः पूर्वनिर्धारितपञ्चाङ्गे घटनानां सूचीं प्रदर्शयति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:81
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Main features of &konsolekalendar;:"
msgstr "&konsolecalendar; इत्यस्य मुख्यविशेषताः:"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:83
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "View calendar entries from a start date/time to end date/time"
msgstr "आरम्भदिनाङ्कात्/समयात् समाप्तितिथि/समयपर्यन्तं पञ्चाङ्गप्रविष्टयः पश्यन्तु"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:84
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Insert (add) calendar entries"
msgstr "पञ्चाङ्गप्रविष्टयः सम्मिलिताः (जोडयन्तु)"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:85
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Remove (delete) calendar entries"
msgstr "पञ्चाङ्गप्रविष्टयः निष्कासयन्तु (विलोपयन्तु)।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:86
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Modify (change) calendar entries"
msgstr "पञ्चाङ्गप्रविष्टयः परिवर्तयन्तु (परिवर्तयन्तु)।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:87
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Create a new calendar"
msgstr "नूतनं पञ्चाङ्गं रचयन्तु"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:88
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Export calendar entries to other file formats"
msgstr "अन्यसञ्चिकास्वरूपेषु पञ्चाङ्गप्रविष्टयः निर्यातयन्तु"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:89
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Import an existing calendar"
msgstr "विद्यमानं पञ्चाङ्गं आयातयन्तु"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:92
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&konsolekalendar; is <emphasis>not</emphasis> another graphical user "
"interface to a &kde; calendar (i.e. &korganizer;). &konsolekalendar; is "
"intended solely for uses where a graphical user interface is not practical "
"or possible."
msgstr ""
"&konsolekalendar; इति <emphasis>न</emphasis> अन्यत् चित्रात्मकं "
"उपयोक्तृ-अन्तरफलकं &kde; पञ्चाङ्गम् (अर्थात् &korganizer;)। "
"&konsolekalendar; केवलं तेषां उपयोगानां कृते अभिप्रेतम् यत्र चित्रात्मकं "
"उपयोक्तृ-अन्तरफलकं व्यावहारिकं वा सम्भवं वा नास्ति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:97
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&konsolekalendar; does <emphasis>not</emphasis> provide a full-featured "
"language for making queries of the user's calendar: nor is it the intention "
"of the authors to ever write such a capability. Primitive command line "
"options are provided for accessing calendar events within a consecutive "
"range of dates/time stamps."
msgstr ""
"&konsolekalendar; किं <emphasis>न</emphasis> उपयोक्तुः पञ्चाङ्गस्य "
"प्रश्नान् कर्तुं पूर्णविशेषतायुक्तां भाषां प्रदाति: न च लेखकानां अभिप्रायः "
"कदापि एतादृशं सामर्थ्यं लिखितुं। तिथि/समयमुद्राणां क्रमिकपरिधिमध्ये "
"पञ्चाङ्गघटनानां अभिगमनाय आदिम आदेशपङ्क्तिविकल्पाः प्रदत्ताः सन्ति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:107
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Features"
msgstr "गुणाः"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:108
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this chapter you'll learn about the main features of &konsolekalendar; "
"and how to control them using the command line parameters (remember that "
"&konsolekalendar; is not a graphical user interface; it is a command line "
"program only)."
msgstr ""
"अस्मिन् अध्याये भवन्तः &konsolekalendar; तथा च आदेशपङ्क्तिमापदण्डानां "
"उपयोगेन तान् कथं नियन्त्रयितुं शक्यते (स्मरणीयं यत् &konsolekalendar; "
"चित्रात्मकं उपयोक्तृ-अन्तरफलकं नास्ति; केवलं आदेशपङ्क्तिकार्यक्रमः अस्ति) ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:113
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You'll learn about inserting, deleting, and changing calendar events, and "
"how to export events to other file formats. The creation and importation of "
"calendars will also be covered in this chapter."
msgstr ""
"भवन्तः पञ्चाङ्गघटनानां सम्मिलनस्य, विलोपनस्य, परिवर्तनस्य च विषये, "
"अन्यसञ्चिकास्वरूपेषु घटनानां निर्यातस्य विषये च ज्ञास्यन्ति । पञ्चाङ्गानां "
"निर्माणं आयातं च अस्मिन् अध्याये आच्छादयिष्यते ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:121
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Viewing Events"
msgstr "घटनाः पश्यन्"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:123
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In its default mode, or by using the <parameter>--view</parameter> option, "
"&konsolekalendar; will list all events within the range of a specified "
"date/time."
msgstr ""
"तस्य पूर्वनिर्धारितविधाने, अथवा <parameter>--view</parameter> विकल्पस्य "
"उपयोगेन, &konsolekalendar; निर्दिष्टदिनाङ्कस्य/समयस्य परिधिमध्ये सर्वाणि "
"घटनानि सूचीबद्धं करिष्यति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:128
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "To view all of today's events (from 7:00 to 17:00), simply run:"
msgstr "अद्यतनं सर्वाणि आयोजनानि (७:०० तः १७:०० पर्यन्तं) द्रष्टुं केवलं चालयन्तु:"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:131
#. Tag: screen
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt><userinput> <command>konsolekalendar</command>\n"
"</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<prompt>%</prompt><userinput> <command>konsolekalendar</command> इति\n"
"</userinput> इति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:137
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "In this next example, we view all events for the week of August 18-22:"
msgstr ""
"अस्मिन् अग्रिमे उदाहरणे वयं अगस्तमासस्य १८-२२ सप्ताहस्य सर्वाणि घटनानि "
"पश्यामः:"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:140
#. Tag: screen
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt><userinput> <command>konsolekalendar</command> "
"<option>--view</option> <option>--date "
"<replaceable>2016-08-18</replaceable> </option> <option>--end-date "
"<replaceable>2016-08-22</replaceable></option>\n"
"</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<prompt>% .</prompt><userinput><command> कोन्सोलेकलेण्डर</command><option "
"value=--view> --दृश्यं</option><option> --दिनाङ्कः<replaceable> "
"२०१६-०८-१८</replaceable></option><option> --अन्त-तिथि<replaceable> "
"२०१६-०८-२२</replaceable></option></userinput>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:146
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show the next event(s) on the calendar from the current time forward:"
msgstr "वर्तमानसमयात् अग्रे पञ्चाङ्गे अग्रिमघटना (घटनानि) दर्शयतु:"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:149
#. Tag: screen
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt><userinput> <command>konsolekalendar</command> "
"<option>--next</option>\n"
"</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<prompt>% .</prompt><userinput><command> कन्सोल पञ्चाङ्गम्</command><option "
"value=--next> --अग्रिम</option></userinput>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:155
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "To view all events for the next 5 days run:"
msgstr "अग्रिम ५ दिवसानां सर्वाणि आयोजनानि द्रष्टुं चालयन्तु:"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:158
#. Tag: screen
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt><userinput> <command>konsolekalendar</command> "
"<option>--show-next</option> <replaceable>5</replaceable>\n"
"\n"
"</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<prompt>% .</prompt><userinput><command> सान्त्वना "
"पञ्चाङ्गाः</command><option value=--show-next> "
"--प्रदर्शन-अनन्तरम्</option><replaceable> ५</replaceable></userinput>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:166
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Inserting Events"
msgstr "घटनाः सम्मिलितः"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:168
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&konsolekalendar; can insert events into a calendar or calendar resource "
"using the <parameter>--add</parameter> command line argument. Events "
"successfully inserted will be immediately shown by &kde; calendar "
"applications (like &korganizer;)."
msgstr ""
"&konsolekalendar; <parameter>--add</parameter> आदेशपङ्क्तितर्कस्य उपयोगेन "
"पञ्चाङ्गे अथवा पञ्चाङ्गसंसाधने घटनाः सम्मिलितुं शक्नोति । सफलतया सम्मिलिताः "
"घटनाः तत्क्षणमेव &kde; कैलेण्डर-अनुप्रयोगाः (&korganizer; इव) ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:173
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "You get a list of all calendars and their id's using:"
msgstr ""
"भवन्तः सर्वेषां पञ्चाङ्गानां सूचीं प्राप्नुवन्ति तथा च तेषां id's इत्यस्य "
"उपयोगेन:"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:176
#. Tag: screen
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt><userinput> <command>konsolekalendar</command> "
"<option>--list-calendars</option></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<prompt>, ९.</prompt><userinput><command> "
"सान्त्वपञ्चाङ्गम्</command><option value=--list-calendars> "
"--सूची-पञ्चाङ्गाः</option></userinput>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:179
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the following example, an event starting on 2016-12-01 (December 1, "
"2016) at 10:00 and ending at 12:00 with summary \"Doctor Visit\" will be "
"inserted into the user's calendar resource with the id 8:"
msgstr ""
"निम्नलिखित उदाहरणे 2016-12-01 (दिसम्बर 1, 2016) दिनाङ्के 10:00 वादने आरभ्य "
"12:00 वादने समाप्तं कृत्वा सारांशेन \"Doctor Visit\" इति कार्यक्रमः "
"उपयोक्तुः पञ्चाङ्गसंसाधने id 8 इत्यनेन सह सम्मिलितः भविष्यति:"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:185
#. Tag: screen
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt><userinput> <command>konsolekalendar</command> "
"<option>--add</option> <option>--calendar 8</option> <option>--date "
"<replaceable>2016-12-03</replaceable></option> <option>--time "
"<replaceable>10:00</replaceable></option> \\\n"
"<option>--end-time <replaceable>12:00</replaceable></option> "
"<option>--summary <replaceable>\"Doctor "
"Visit\"</replaceable></option></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<prompt>% .</prompt><userinput><command> कोन्सोलेकलेण्डर</command><option "
"value=--add> --संयोजयति</option><option value=\"--calendar 8\"> "
"--पञ्चाङ्गम् 8</option><option> --दिनाङ्कः<replaceable> "
"२०१६-१२-०३</replaceable></option><option> --कालः<replaceable> १०:०० "
"वादने</replaceable></option> \\ .<option> --अन्तकालः<replaceable> १२:०० "
"वादने</replaceable></option><option> --संक्षेपः<replaceable> &quot;वैद्यस्य "
"भ्रमणम्&quot; ।</replaceable></option></userinput>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:191
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this example, a birthday event is added into the user's calendar "
"resource with the id 8:"
msgstr ""
"अस्मिन् उदाहरणे, उपयोक्तुः पञ्चाङ्गसंसाधने जन्मदिवसस्य घटना id 8 इत्यनेन सह "
"योजितं भवति:"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:195
#. Tag: screen
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt><userinput> <command>konsolekalendar</command> "
"<option>--add</option> <option>--calendar 8</option> <option>--date "
"<replaceable>2016-12-06</replaceable></option> <option>--summary "
"<replaceable>\"My Birthday\"</replaceable></option> \\\n"
"<option>--description <replaceable>\"Party "
"Time\"</replaceable></option></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<prompt>% .</prompt><userinput><command> कोन्सोलेकलेण्डर</command><option "
"value=--add> --संयोजयति</option><option value=\"--calendar 8\"> "
"--पञ्चाङ्गम् 8</option><option> --दिनाङ्कः<replaceable> "
"२०१६-१२-०६</replaceable></option><option> --संक्षेपः<replaceable> &quot;मम "
"जन्मदिनम्&quot;।</replaceable></option> \\ .<option> "
"--वर्णनम्‌<replaceable> &quot;पार्टी समय&quot; "
".</replaceable></option></userinput>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:201
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here a one week vacation is inserted into a calendar with the id 8:"
msgstr "अत्र एकसप्ताहस्य अवकाशः id 8 इत्यनेन सह पञ्चाङ्गे सम्मिलितः भवति:"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:204
#. Tag: screen
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt><userinput> <command>konsolekalendar</command> "
"<option>--add</option> <option>--calendar "
"<replaceable>12</replaceable></option> <option>--date "
"<replaceable>2017-08-01</replaceable></option> \\\n"
"<option>--end-date <replaceable>2017-08-07</replaceable></option> "
"<option>--summary <replaceable>\"Vacation\"</replaceable></option> "
"<option>--description <replaceable>\"Nobody will ever find "
"me!\"</replaceable></option></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<prompt>% .</prompt><userinput><command> कोन्सोलेकलेण्डर</command><option "
"value=--add> --संयोजयति</option><option> --पञ्चाङ्गम्<replaceable> "
"१२</replaceable></option><option> --दिनाङ्कः<replaceable> "
"२०१७-०८-०१</replaceable></option> \\ .<option> --अन्त-तिथि<replaceable> "
"२०१७-०८-०७</replaceable></option><option> --संक्षेपः<replaceable> "
"&quot;अवकाशः&quot;</replaceable></option><option> --वर्णनम्‌<replaceable> "
"&quot;कश्चित् मां कदापि न "
"प्राप्स्यति!&quot;</replaceable></option></userinput>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:212
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removing Entries"
msgstr "प्रविष्टयः निष्कासयन्"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:214
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&konsolekalendar; supports the removal of entries in a calendar file or "
"resource using the <parameter>--delete</parameter> command line argument. "
"Calendar entries to be removed are specified exactly by their Unique-string "
"identifier (<acronym>UID</acronym>) using the <parameter>--uid</parameter> "
"option. <acronym>UIDs</acronym> are found by first viewing the event, using "
"the <parameter>--view</parameter>, <parameter>--next</parameter> or "
"<parameter>--show-next</parameter> options."
msgstr ""
"&konsolekalendar; <parameter>--delete</parameter> आदेशपङ्क्तितर्कस्य "
"उपयोगेन पञ्चाङ्गसञ्चिकायां संसाधने वा प्रविष्टीनां निष्कासनं समर्थयति । "
"निष्कासनीयाः पञ्चाङ्गप्रविष्टयः <parameter>--uid</parameter> विकल्पस्य "
"उपयोगेन तेषां Unique-string-परिचयेन (<acronym>UID</acronym>) सम्यक् "
"निर्दिष्टाः भवन्ति । <acronym>UIDs</acronym> प्रथमं घटनां दृष्ट्वा, "
"<parameter>--view</parameter>, <parameter>--next</parameter> अथवा "
"<parameter>--show-next</ पैरामीटर> विकल्पाः।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:222
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Events successfully deleted will be immediately removed from within &kde; "
"calendar applications (&korganizer; for example)."
msgstr ""
"सफलतया विलोपिताः घटनाः तत्क्षणमेव अन्तः निष्कासिताः भविष्यन्ति &kde; "
"पञ्चाङ्गानुप्रयोगाः (&korganizer; उदाहरणार्थम्) ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:225
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you delete something from the calendar you <emphasis>cannot</emphasis> "
"undo it! In other words, when you delete an entry you cannot reverse the "
"deletion. It's gone for good."
msgstr ""
"यदा भवन्तः पञ्चाङ्गात् किमपि विलोपयन्ति तदा भवन्तः <emphasis>न</emphasis> "
"तत् पूर्ववत् कर्तुं न शक्नुवन्ति! अन्येषु शब्देषु यदा भवन्तः प्रविष्टिं "
"विलोपयन्ति तदा भवन्तः लोपं विपर्ययितुं न शक्नुवन्ति । हिताय गतं।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:230
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here we delete a calendar entry with <acronym>UID</acronym> "
"<replaceable>&konsolekalendar;-1887551750.196</replaceable>:"
msgstr ""
"अत्र वयं <acronym>UID</acronym> "
"<replaceable>&konsolekalendar;-1887551750.196</replaceable> इत्यनेन सह "
"पञ्चाङ्गप्रविष्टिं विलोपयामः:"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:233
#. Tag: screen
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt><userinput> <command>konsolekalendar</command> "
"<option>--delete</option> <option>--uid "
"<replaceable>&konsolekalendar;-1887551750.196</replaceable></option></"
"userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<prompt>, ९.</prompt><userinput><command> "
"सान्त्वपञ्चाङ्गम्</command><option value=--delete> --लुप्</option><option> "
"--उइड्<replaceable> "
"&amp;konsolekalendar;-1887551750.196</replaceable></option></userinput>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:241
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Modifying Entries"
msgstr "प्रविष्टीनां परिवर्तनं करणम्"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:243
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&konsolekalendar; supports the modification of existing entries in a "
"calendar file or resource using the <parameter>--change</parameter> command "
"line argument. Calendar entries to be modified are specified exactly by "
"their Unique-string identifier (<acronym>UID</acronym>) using the "
"<parameter>--uid</parameter> option. <acronym>UIDs</acronym> are found by "
"first viewing the event, using the <parameter>--view</parameter>, "
"<parameter>--next</parameter> or <parameter>--show-next</parameter> options."
msgstr ""
"&konsolekalendar; <parameter>--change</parameter> आदेशपङ्क्तितर्कस्य "
"उपयोगेन पञ्चाङ्गसञ्चिकायां संसाधने वा विद्यमानप्रविष्टीनां परिवर्तनं "
"समर्थयति । परिवर्तनीयाः पञ्चाङ्गप्रविष्टयः <parameter>--uid</parameter> "
"विकल्पस्य उपयोगेन तेषां Unique-string identifier (<acronym>UID</acronym>) "
"इत्यनेन सम्यक् निर्दिष्टाः भवन्ति । <acronym>UIDs</acronym> प्रथमं घटनां "
"दृष्ट्वा, <parameter>--view</parameter>, <parameter>--next</parameter> अथवा "
"<parameter>--show-next</ पैरामीटर> विकल्पाः।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:251
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Changing behaves in the same way as inserting: you can change an event's "
"start date and time, end date and time, summary, location, and description. "
"Events successfully changed will be immediately shown modified within &kde; "
"calendar applications (&korganizer;)."
msgstr ""
"परिवर्तनं सम्मिलितस्य समानं व्यवहारं करोति: भवान् कस्यापि घटनायाः "
"आरम्भदिनाङ्कं समयं च, समाप्तिदिनाङ्कं समयं च, सारांशं, स्थानं, विवरणं च "
"परिवर्तयितुं शक्नोति । सफलतया परिवर्तिताः घटनाः तत्क्षणमेव &kde; पञ्चाङ्ग "
"अनुप्रयोगाः (&korganizer;)."

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:257
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Example:</emphasis> Here we change the summary and description of "
"a calendar entry with <acronym>UID</acronym> "
"<replaceable>&konsolekalendar;-1887551750.196</replaceable>:"
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>उदाहरणम् :</emphasis> अत्र वयं <acronym>UID</acronym> "
"<replaceable>&konsolekalendar;-1887551750.196</replaceable> इत्यनेन "
"पञ्चाङ्गप्रविष्टेः सारांशं वर्णनं च परिवर्तयामः:"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:262
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt><userinput> <command>konsolekalendar</command> "
"<option>--change</option> <option>--uid "
"<replaceable>&konsolekalendar;-1887551750.196</replaceable></option> "
"<option>--summary <replaceable>\"Get my head "
"examined\"</replaceable></option> <option>--description "
"<replaceable>\"don't go to that doctor anymore!\"</replaceable></option> "
"</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<prompt>% .</prompt><userinput><command> कोन्सोलेकलेण्डर</command><option "
"value=--change> --परिवर्तय</option><option> --उइड्<replaceable> "
"&amp;konsolekalendar;-1887551750.196</replaceable></option><option> "
"--संक्षेपः<replaceable> &quot;मम शिरः परीक्ष्यताम्&quot; "
"इति।</replaceable></option><option> --वर्णनम्‌<replaceable> &quot;तस्य "
"वैद्यस्य समीपं मा गच्छ इतः परम्!&quot;</replaceable></option></userinput>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:275
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a New Calendar File"
msgstr "नूतनं पञ्चाङ्गसञ्चिकां निर्मातुं"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:277
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&konsolekalendar; can be used to create new calendars from existing files. "
"You can create the calendar using the option <option>--create</option> with "
"the filename as argument. The file must be a valid <acronym>iCal</acronym> "
"or <acronym>vCal</acronym> file."
msgstr ""
"&amp;konsolekalendar; विद्यमानसञ्चिकाभ्यः नूतनानि पञ्चाङ्गानि निर्मातुं "
"उपयोक्तुं शक्यते । विकल्पस्य उपयोगेन भवान् पञ्चाङ्गं निर्मातुम् "
"अर्हति<option value=--create> --निर्मियताम्</option> सञ्चिकानाम तर्करूपेण "
"सह । सञ्चिका वैधः <acronym>iCal</acronym> अथवा <acronym>vCal</acronym> "
"सञ्चिका भवितुमर्हति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:281
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note: You can not use the option <option>--dry-run</option> to test if the "
"resource can be created."
msgstr ""
"नोटः- भवान् विकल्पस्य उपयोगं कर्तुं न शक्नोति<option value=--dry-run> "
"--शुष्क-धावन</option> संसाधनं निर्मातुं शक्यते वा इति परीक्षितुं ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:284
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note: &konsolekalendar; needs the file to work, so never delete the file by "
"hand."
msgstr ""
"टिप्पणी: &konsolekalendar; कार्यं कर्तुं सञ्चिकायाः आवश्यकता वर्तते, अतः "
"कदापि सञ्चिकां हस्तेन न विलोपयन्तु ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:287
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Technical sidenote: &konsolekalendar; creates with this command a new "
"<acronym>Akonadi</acronym> resource pointing to this file. It does not "
"prevent you to create multiple resources pointing to the same file."
msgstr ""
"तकनीकी पार्श्वटिप्पणी: &konsolekalendar; एतेन आदेशेन एतां सञ्चिकां प्रति "
"सूचयन् नूतनं <acronym>Akonadi</acronym> संसाधनं निर्माति । एकां सञ्चिकां "
"दर्शयन्तः बहुसंसाधनं निर्मातुं भवन्तं न निवारयति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:292
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Create a new calendar from an existing file named "
"<filename><replaceable>vacation.ics</replaceable></filename>:"
msgstr ""
"<filename><replaceable>vacation.ics</replaceable></filename> इति नाम्ना "
"विद्यमानसञ्चिकातः नूतनं पञ्चाङ्गं रचयन्तु:"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:295
#. Tag: screen
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt><userinput> <command>konsolekalendar</command> "
"<option>--create</option> "
"<option><replaceable>vacation.ics</replaceable></option></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<prompt>% .</prompt><userinput><command> कोन्सोलेकलेण्डर</command><option "
"value=--create> --निर्मियताम्</option><option><replaceable> "
"अवकाश.ics</replaceable></option></userinput>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:300
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The resource will be named <quote>vacation</quote> using "
"<option>--list-calendars</option>"
msgstr ""
"संसाधनस्य नामकरणं भविष्यति<quote> अवकाशः</quote> using<option "
"value=--list-calendars> --सूची-पञ्चाङ्गाः</option>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:302
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is not possible to delete an <acronym>Akonadi</acronym> resource with "
"&konsolekalendar;, you have to use &korganizer; or "
"<application>akonadiconsole</application>."
msgstr ""
"&konsolekalendar; इत्यनेन <acronym>Akonadi</acronym> संसाधनं विलोपयितुं न "
"शक्यते, भवद्भिः &korganizer; अथवा <application>akonadiconsole</application> "
"इति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:309
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Exporting to Other Formats"
msgstr "अन्येषु प्रारूपेषु निर्यातः"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:311
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&konsolekalendar; can export a calendar to other well known formats. "
"Exporting is a special form of viewing. By default, events are viewed in "
"<quote>&konsolekalendar; text</quote> format. To change the viewing format "
"use the <parameter>--export-type</parameter> command line argument."
msgstr ""
"&konsolekalendar; अन्येषु प्रसिद्धेषु प्रारूपेषु पञ्चाङ्गं निर्यातयितुं "
"शक्नोति । निर्यातनं दर्शनस्य विशेषरूपम् अस्ति । पूर्वनिर्धारितरूपेण, घटनाः "
"<quote>&konsolekalendar; पाठ</quote>स्वरूपम् । दृश्यस्वरूपं परिवर्तयितुं "
"<parameter>--export-type</parameter> आदेशपङ्क्तितर्कस्य उपयोगं कुर्वन्तु ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:316
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To see a list of all supported export formats, use the "
"<parameter>--export-list</parameter> option, as in:"
msgstr ""
"सर्वेषां समर्थितनिर्यातस्वरूपाणां सूचीं द्रष्टुं "
"<parameter>--export-list</parameter> विकल्पस्य उपयोगं कुर्वन्तु, यथा:"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:322
#. Tag: screen
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt><userinput> <command>konsolekalendar</command> "
"<option>--export-list</option></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<prompt>% .</prompt><userinput><command> सान्त्वना "
"पञ्चाङ्गाः</command><option value=--export-list> "
"--निर्यात-सूची</option></userinput>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:330
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Export Formats"
msgstr "निर्यात प्रारूप"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:332
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some, but not necessarily all, of the supported formats are described in "
"the this section."
msgstr "समर्थितस्वरूपेषु केचन, परन्तु सर्वे न, अस्मिन् खण्डे वर्णिताः सन्ति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:336
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "&konsolekalendar; Text Format"
msgstr "&console calendar; पाठस्वरूपम्"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:338
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&konsolekalendar; Text Format is &konsolekalendar;'s native format and is "
"designed to be comfortable to read and to be parsed by follow-on scripts."
msgstr ""
"&konsolekalendar; पाठस्वरूपं &konsolekalendar;इत्यस्य मूलस्वरूपं भवति तथा च "
"पठितुं सहजं भवितुं अनुवर्तीलिपिभिः विश्लेषणं कर्तुं च डिजाइनं कृतम् अस्ति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:342
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &konsolekalendar; Text Format is:"
msgstr "इति &konsolekalendar; पाठस्वरूपम् अस्ति : १."

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:344
#. Tag: screen
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Date:\\t&lt;Incidence Date&gt;(dddd yyyy-MM-dd)\n"
"[\\t&lt;Incidence Start Time&gt;(hh:mm) - &lt;Incidence End "
"Time&gt;(hh:mm)]\n"
"Summary:\n"
"\\t&lt;Incidence Summary | \"(no summary available)\"&gt;\n"
"Location:\n"
"\\t&lt;Incidence Location | \"(no location available)\"&gt;\n"
"Description:\n"
"\\t&lt;Incidence Description | \"(no description available)\"&gt;\n"
"UID:\n"
"\\t&lt;Incidence UID&gt;\n"
"--------------------------------------------------"
msgstr ""
"तिथि:\\t&lt;घटनातिथि&gt;(dddd yyyy-MM-dd)\n"
"[\\t&lt;घटना प्रारम्भ समय&gt;(hh:mm) - &lt;घटना समाप्ति समय&gt;(hh:mm)]\n"
"संक्षेपः:\n"
"\\t&lt;घटनासारांश | \"(सारांशः उपलब्धः नास्ति)\"&gt;\n"
"स्थानीय:\n"
"\\t&lt;घटना स्थान | \"(कोऽपि स्थानं उपलब्धं नास्ति)\"&gt;\n"
"वर्णनम्‌:\n"
"\\t&lt;घटना वर्णन | \"(कोऽपि वर्णनं उपलब्धं नास्ति)\"&gt;\n"
"यूआईडी : १.\n"
"\\t&lt;घटना UID&gt;\n"
"----------------------------------------------------------------------------"
"----------------------------------------------------------------------------"
"----------------------------------------------------------------------------"
"----------------------------------------------------------------------------"
"----------------------------------------------------------------------------"
"---"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:348
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Output of <userinput> <command>konsolekalendar</command> "
"<option>--next</option> <option>--export-type</option> "
"<option>Text</option></userinput>:"
msgstr ""
"के उत्पादनम्<userinput><command> कोन्सोलेकलेण्डर</command><option "
"value=--next> --अग्रिम</option><option value=--export-type> "
"--निर्यात-प्रकारः</option><option value=Text> पाठ</option></userinput> : १."

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:350
#. Tag: screen
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Date:   Tuesday 2016-11-29\n"
"        08:00 - 09:00\n"
"Summary:\n"
"        Staff Meeting\n"
"Location:\n"
"        Conference Room\n"
"Description:\n"
"        Meet with the entire staff to discuss the project.\n"
"UID:\n"
"        &konsolekalendar;-1924621834.134\n"
"--------------------------------------------------"
msgstr ""
"दिनाङ्कः मंगलवार २०१६-११-२९\n"
"        ०८:०० - ०९:०० यावत्\n"
"संक्षेपः:\n"
"        कर्मचारी सभा\n"
"स्थानीय:\n"
"        सम्मेलन कक्ष\n"
"वर्णनम्‌:\n"
"        परियोजनायाः विषये चर्चां कर्तुं सम्पूर्णैः कर्मचारिभिः सह मिलन्तु।\n"
"यूआईडी : १.\n"
"        &konsolekalendar;-1924621834.134\n"
"----------------------------------------------------------------------------"
"----------------------------------------------------------------------------"
"----------------------------------------------------------------------------"
"----------------------------------------------------------------------------"
"----------------------------------------------------------------------------"
"---"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:357
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "&konsolekalendar; Short Text Format"
msgstr "&console calendar; लघु पाठ प्रारूप"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:359
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Short Text Format provides a more compact, less verbose version of "
"&konsolekalendar;'s native format."
msgstr ""
"लघुपाठस्वरूपं &konsolekalendar;इत्यस्य देशीयस्वरूपस्य अधिकं संकुचितं, "
"न्यूनवाचकसंस्करणं प्रदाति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:362
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &konsolekalendar; Short Text Format is:"
msgstr "इति &konsolekalendar; लघुपाठस्वरूपम् अस्ति : १."

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:364
#. Tag: screen
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"[--------------------------------------------------]\n"
"{&lt;Incidence Date&gt;(dddd yyyy-MM-dd)]\n"
"[&lt;Incidence Start Time&gt;(hh:mm) - &lt;Incidence End Time&gt;(hh:mm) | "
"\"\\t\"]\n"
